          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">What is the Consolation Prize?</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
              A consolation prize of ₹1,000 is awarded to all tickets with matching 5 digits in all other series across the same draw.
